      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“你憎恨的人是我吧？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The person you hate is me, isn't it?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "对吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Isn't that right?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "不然为什么明知我在病中，偏要这个时候卖掉雏人偶……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Otherwise, why would you insist on selling the hina dolls now, knowing full well that I am ill...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "要卖掉雏人偶，还如此欺负阿鹤。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You want to sell the hina dolls, and you torment O-Tsuru like this as well.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "如果不是因为憎恨我，为什么要这么做呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If it is not because you hate me, why would you do such a thing?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "是吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Isn't that so?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00607",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "你为什么憎恨我呢？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why do you hate me?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
